# FastAPI AI Backend Platform

A production-focused AI backend built with **FastAPI**, emphasizing clean architecture, separation of concerns, asynchronous programming, structured logging, robust error handling, and scalable AI service integration.

Rather than being a simple CRUD application, this project is designed to explore real-world backend engineering practices while integrating modern AI capabilities.

---

# Features

- AI-powered text processing services
- JWT Authentication
- OAuth2 Bearer Token authentication
- Async FastAPI architecture
- PostgreSQL database
- SQLAlchemy ORM (Async)
- Alembic migrations
- Pydantic request/response validation
- Global exception handling
- Structured API responses
- Centralized logging system
- Separation of concerns (Router → Service → AI Layer → Utilities)
- Production-style project structure

---

# AI Services

Currently implemented AI endpoints include:

- Content Rephrasing
- Title Generation
- Text Summarization
- Sentiment Analysis
- Intent Classification

Each service follows a consistent architecture with validation, logging, retry logic, structured responses, and centralized exception handling.

---

# Project Structure

```text
app/
│
├── routers/
│   ├── auth/
│   ├── users/
│   ├── posts/
│   └── ai/
│
├── db_tables/
│
├── utils/
│   ├── logging/
│   ├── schemas.py
│   ├── response handlers
│   └── helper utilities
│
├── Ai/
│
├── core/
│
├── migrations/
│
└── main.py
```

